            },
            "description": "### WebSocket Connection:\n\n**URL:** `ws://localhost:5000`\n\n**Authentication:** Send JWT token as query parameter:\n`ws://localhost:5000?token={{token}}`\n\n**Events to listen for:**\n- `orderStatusUpdate` - Order status changed\n- `deliveryLocationUpdate` - Delivery person location updated\n- `orderAssigned` - Delivery person assigned to order\n- `loyaltyPointsEarned` - Loyalty points earned\n- `rewardRedeemed` - Reward redeemed successfully\n\n**Example usage in Postman:**\n1. Create a new WebSocket request\n2. Connect to `ws://localhost:5000?token={{token}}`\n3. Listen for events\n4. When you update an order status, you'll receive real-time notifications"
